ry system it outperforms anything  that the Russians have had now when we  see these combat armored vehicles  provided by the Germans and the  Americans in theater and if of course  they're joined by British tanks again we  could see significant developments come  around spring when the weather changes a  little bit what you will see is that the  um the ukrainians then have the ability  ability to launch some pretty  sophisticated counter-offensives and you  might see them breaking through Russian  lands other lines at the line of contact  success is similar to what we saw in  cursing now the Russian reaction um to  all of this has been fairly Furious they  accused the Western allies of using  Ukraine and Ukrainian blood to weaken  Russia they argue that all will happen  is that this war will just go on much  longer they say that they will carry on  fighting they are a superior fighting  force and they will eventually win now  that may be true it may not be true but  I think in a response to this we are  most likely to see sometime later in the  New Year Vladimir Putin announcing the  mobilization of even more men but I  think the other thing to the other  takeaway point from all of this is that  this this war is not going to end in the  next couple of months it really is  probably going to take uh the next year  or so but there are certainly many  people in the west now who believe that  Ukrainian Ukraine can be victorious over  Russian forces
 

